+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds: a prior workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds has been reverted, so development environments now enforce the same cryptographic certificate verification as production, keeping the security posture consistent across build environments.
